import{_ as t,o,c as n,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 491 | Dragon Rune · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: The Networking Transformation of Single-Log Type","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 491 | Dragon Rune · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: The Networking Transformation of Single-Log Type","no":491,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Rune","Gu Chensha","Anchor Symbiosis","Networking Transformation","Single-Log"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","05-Myriad-Ranks Joint-Advancement Basic Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0491_模块2-龙符-锚点共生替代方案-独木式的网络化改造.md","filePath":"en/0491_模块2-龙符-锚点共生替代方案-独木式的网络化改造.md"}'),s={name:"en/0491_模块2-龙符-锚点共生替代方案-独木式的网络化改造.md"};function a(r,e,l,h,u,d){return o(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-491-dragon-rune-·-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-the-networking-transformation-of-single-log-type" tabindex="-1">Entry 491 | Dragon Rune · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: The Networking Transformation of Single-Log Type <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-491-dragon-rune-·-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-the-networking-transformation-of-single-log-type" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 491 | Dragon Rune · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: The Networking Transformation of Single-Log Type&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Rune Decomposition (Entry 7 · Conclusion) | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 03, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-transform-a-single-log-into-a-forest" tabindex="-1">Introduction: transform a single log into a forest <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-transform-a-single-log-into-a-forest" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: transform a single log into a forest&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — ultimate transformation plan for single-log civilization: how to transform &quot;Gu Chensha alone carries the cosmos&quot; into &quot;Myriad Ranks co-build a network.&quot; The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Transformation three steps:</p><ol><li><strong>Tiandao Law publicized</strong>: Gu Chensha writes all his understanding of Tiandao Law into public canon; Myriad Ranks learnable, teachable.</li><li><strong>Functions distributed</strong>: sky-mending from &quot;Gu Chensha&#39;s one-person feat&quot; becomes &quot;Myriad-Ranks co-built project&quot;; sin-bearing from &quot;he carries for Myriad Ranks&quot; becomes &quot;Myriad Ranks bear themselves, supervise each other&quot;; defining the Great Dao from &quot;he alone decides&quot; becomes &quot;Anchor Council collective legislation.&quot;</li><li><strong>Institution building</strong>: the new universes he creates, from the start establish Anchor Council + Symbiotic Court + Anchor Supervisory Committee three-layer governance structure.</li></ol><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-pre-transformation" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Pre-Transformation) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-pre-transformation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Pre-Transformation)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Pre-transformation single-log collapse mechanism detailed in Entry 487. Transformation&#39;s core is replacing &quot;one person carries&quot; with &quot;network carries.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-pre-transformation" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Pre-Transformation) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-pre-transformation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Pre-Transformation)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Post-transformation:</p><ul><li><strong>Abolish &quot;bear sins for Myriad Ranks&quot;</strong>: Myriad Ranks bear their own karma.</li><li><strong>Abolish &quot;I allow you to become dragons&quot;</strong>: Myriad Ranks inherently qualified to become dragons; only need to break monopoly.</li><li><strong>Gu Chensha role transformation</strong>: from &quot;number one in history&quot; to &quot;one among Myriad Ranks&quot;; he remains great, but he is no longer the only one.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-overview-table" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Overview Table) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-overview-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Overview Table)&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Single-Log (Pre-Transformation)</th><th>Network (Post-Transformation)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>He alone mends sky</td><td>Myriad-Ranks co-built sky-mending project</td></tr><tr><td>He bears sins for Myriad Ranks</td><td>Myriad Ranks bear themselves</td></tr><tr><td>He defines the Great Dao</td><td>Council collective legislation</td></tr><tr><td>He creates universes no institutions</td><td>New universe immediately builds three-layer governance</td></tr><tr><td>He falls, cosmos collapses</td><td>Distributed redundancy; any individual absence does not affect</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Quest Sediment Domain runs full transformation: post-transformation first millennium, among Myriad Ranks over a thousand strong ones reach Tiandao Law threshold; Gu Chensha himself from &quot;the sole pillar&quot; becomes &quot;one of thousand founders&quot;; in a second-millennium &quot;hypothetical fall,&quot; the cosmos runs safely — <strong>single log becomes forest; forest is not afraid of any one tree falling.</strong></p><p>The transformation plan&#39;s key is not making Gu Chensha disappear, but making Gu Chensha from &quot;the only&quot; to &quot;one of.&quot; He remains great — he is the first to cultivate Tiandao Law, the first to publicize Tiandao-Law understanding, the first to propose &quot;sky-mending is engineering not feat.&quot; But he is no longer the only one. Over ten thousand new Tiandao-Law strong ones have their own understanding, own contributions, own creations. Gu Chensha&#39;s greatness is diluted by Myriad Ranks&#39; greatness — this is not belittling him, this is fulfilling him. <strong>A truly great person should hope his greatness is surpassed by more people, not fewer.</strong></p><p>The transformation plan also involves a psychological-level shift: Gu Chensha must step out of his self-identity as &quot;number one in history.&quot; This is hardest for any strong one who reaches the peak — admitting he is not the only, admitting Myriad Ranks can reach the same height, admitting his greatness can be surpassed. But Heng Yuan Zhou believes: <strong>true greatness is not &quot;no one can surpass me,&quot; but &quot;I am willing to let everyone surpass me.&quot;</strong> If Gu Chensha can take this step, he from &quot;single log&quot; becomes &quot;the starting point of the forest.&quot; He is still the first tree, but the forest will grow around him — this is far greater than him standing alone in an empty cosmos.</p><p>The transformation plan&#39;s ultimate goal is making Gu Chensha from &quot;the only&quot; to &quot;the starting point.&quot; He remains the first to cultivate Tiandao Law, the first to publicize Tiandao-Law understanding, the first to propose &quot;sky-mending is engineering not feat.&quot; But he is no longer the only one — over ten thousand new Tiandao-Law strong ones have their own understanding, own contributions, own creations. Gu Chensha&#39;s greatness is continued by Myriad Ranks&#39; greatness — <strong>a truly great person should hope his greatness becomes Myriad Ranks&#39; starting point, not Myriad Ranks&#39; ceiling.</strong></p><p>If Gu Chensha can take this step, he from &quot;single log&quot; becomes &quot;the seed of the forest.&quot; After the seed grows into forest, every tree in the forest will remember — it is this first tree that made the whole forest possible. This is not belittling Gu Chensha; this is his highest fulfillment.</p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Pre-transformation</strong>: self-consistency low; retcon risk extremely high</li><li><strong>Post-transformation</strong>: self-consistency high; retcon risk low</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: from &quot;extremely high&quot; drops to &quot;extremely low&quot;</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cosmos-tier understanding publicized; from one person cultivating to ten thousand co-building</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: return Myriad Ranks&#39; subjectivity and evolution qualification</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo only benefits humans; this plan covers 99% of Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: humans, exotic beasts, plant spirits, mechanical races, consciousness races all have roads</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: networked cosmos closest to symbiotic cosmos</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gu Chensha need not disappear. What he needs is <strong>from the only to one of.</strong> Heng Yuan Zhou believes: no matter how sturdy a single log, it cannot prop up a true cosmos; only forest can. <strong>Let greatness from one person, become Myriad Ranks&#39; co-built ability — this is &quot;all beings between heaven and earth can become dragons&quot;&#39;s true realization.</strong></p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Rune · Anchor-Symbiosis alternative · the networking transformation of single-log type described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./485_模块2-龙符-总论古尘沙与独木式文明定性.html">Entry 485 · Overview</a> · <a href="./489_模块2-龙符-天地众生皆可成龙批判-被成龙的恩赐制.html">Entry 489 · &quot;All Can Become Dragons&quot; Critique</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=t(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
